# Model Card: Group 16 Real-Time NIDS Classifier (v1.0.0)

## Model Details
- **Developer:** Group 16 (FUSE AI-201 Capstone Team)
- **Model Architecture:** Random Forest Classifier (200 Estimators, max_depth=20) + SMOTE Oversampling
- **Target Category:** 5-Class Network Intrusion Detection (Normal, DoS, Probe, R2L, U2R)
- **Input Features:** 41 features from NSL-KDD benchmark telemetry (3 categorical, 38 numerical)

## Intended Use & Responsible AI Governance
- **Operational Scope:** Advisory Human-in-the-Loop decision support for SOC analysts.
- **Enforcement Boundary:** 100% Non-Enforcement (No automated packet dropping or firewall modification).
- **Explainability:** Integrated SHAP force and summary plots for every flagged connection.

## Performance Metrics (Isolated Test Set: 22,544 records)
- **Macro F1-Score:** 0.86
- **Macro Recall:** 0.84
- **Average Latency:** 0.042 seconds / batch record

### Class Breakdown
- Normal Traffic: F1 0.96 (Precision 0.96, Recall 0.97)
- Denial of Service (DoS): F1 0.93 (Precision 0.94, Recall 0.92)
- Surveillance / Probe: F1 0.88 (Precision 0.89, Recall 0.88)
- Remote-to-Local (R2L): F1 0.78 (Precision 0.82, Recall 0.74)
- User-to-Root (U2R): F1 0.75 (Precision 0.79, Recall 0.71)
